. ENCOURAGEMENT TO THE FAITHFUL REMNANT OF ISRAEL TO TRUST IN GOD FOR DELIVERANCE, BOTH FROM THEIR LONG BABYLONIAN EXILE, AND FROM THEIR PRESENT DISPERSION. 

    1. me--the God of your fathers. 

    ye ... follow after righteousness--the godly portion of the nation;

). 

    arms--put for Himself; I by My might. 

    judge-- (

